            "action_name": {
              "value": "Call of the Damned"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory)\n\nThe queen sends out shriek to all sluagh within 1 mile, summoning them to her. This typically calls 2d4 sluagh reapers. If the queen is facing foes strong enough to threaten her, these are likely too weak to pose a threat but can assist by fetching items or getting in enemies' way."
