        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Eat Soul"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(necromancy, occult)\n\nThe queen touches a dying creature or a creature that died within the past 1 hour with her proboscis. If the target is dying, it must attempt a DC 41 Fortitude save; on a failure, its dying value increases by 2 (3 on a critical failure). If the target is dead, the queen devours the soul. Unless the queen is destroyed, the target can't be returned to life through any means, even powerful magic such as wish."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
